    {
      "source": "Creates a Singleton <a href=\"../RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction</code></a> using the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a>.",
